{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid","content_id":"a950ae12-46f1-4c92-89d5-d3645ca705c2","description":"UK Statement for the Urgent Debate on El Obeid. Delivered by the UK's Human Rights Ambassador, Eleanor Sanders.","details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Mr President,</p>\n\n<p>We are appalled by the deteriorating situation in El Obeid.</p>\n\n<p>As we have heard repeatedly this morning, escalating drone strikes have killed civilians and destroyed civilian infrastructure. Key supply routes have been hit, along with fuel stations and the electricity grid.</p>\n\n<p>Access to basic services has been cut off for over 500,000 people – and 100,000 already displaced.  </p>\n\n<p>Last year, the world watched in horror as the Rapid Support Forces raped, pillaged, and murdered their way through El Fasher. This cannot be repeated.</p>\n\n<p>As our Foreign Secretary has warned, El Obeid is on the precipice of an atrocity that will deepen the wounds already inflicted on Sudan. This Council must act with urgency to help prevent further harm to civilians.</p>\n\n<p>The UK has led efforts to urge de-escalation and adherence to international law so civilians can leave safely and reach desperately needed aid.</p>\n\n<p>This year, the UK is providing £146 million in aid, including £15 million for local responders, ensuring lifesaving aid is delivered to the frontlines of the conflict.</p>\n\n<p>However, aid alone is insufficient. Ending impunity is essential.</p>\n\n<p>The Fact Finding Mission remains vital in establishing accountability for crimes, including any committed in El Obeid. It must be granted full access across Sudan to carry out its mandate.</p>\n\n<p>The violence must end in Sudan. Civilians must be protected.</p>\n\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-03T09:41:00Z"}],"delivered_on":"2026-07-03T00:00:00+01:00","first_public_at":"2026-07-03T10:41:00.000+01:00","image":{"alt_text":"Eleanor Sanders","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/66f261ca53d61b1b433ee2eb/Eleanor_2.jpg"},"location":"Geneva","political":true,"speech_type_explanation":"Transcript of the speech, exactly as it was delivered"},"document_type":"speech","first_published_at":"2026-07-03T10:41:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid.ar","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid.ar","base_path":"/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid.ar","content_id":"a950ae12-46f1-4c92-89d5-d3645ca705c2","document_type":"speech","links":{},"locale":"ar","public_updated_at":"2026-07-03T09:41:00Z","schema_name":"speech","title":"جلسة مجلس حقوق الإنسان 62: كلمة المملكة المتحدة في النقاش العاجل بشأن الأبيض","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid.ar","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid","base_path":"/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid","content_id":"a950ae12-46f1-4c92-89d5-d3645ca705c2","document_type":"speech","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-03T09:41:00Z","schema_name":"speech","title":"UN Human Rights Council 62: UK Statement for the Urgent Debate on El Obeid","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-statement-for-the-urgent-debate-on-el-obeid","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","base_path":"/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","content_id":"9dbff654-cdeb-4ebe-9a12-cd4cc20a033e","details":{"current":false,"ended_on":"2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00","started_on":"2024-07-05T00:00:00+00:00"},"document_type":"government","links":{},"locale":"en","title":"2024 to 2026 Starmer Labour government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/2024-starmer-labour-government"}],"organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1315","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","content_id":"f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26","details":{"acronym":"FCDO","brand":"foreign-commonwealth-development-office","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-main-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f5490aff83b4/s300_fcdo-main-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Foreign, Commonwealth<br/>&amp; Development Office"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","withdrawn":false}],"people":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","base_path":"/government/people/eleanor-sanders","content_id":"4301c606-5fdc-4e77-bbf1-1dbce629f3c8","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2024-09-24T08:38:41Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Eleanor Sanders","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/eleanor-sanders","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1315","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","content_id":"f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26","details":{"acronym":"FCDO","brand":"foreign-commonwealth-development-office","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-main-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f5490aff83b4/s300_fcdo-main-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Foreign, Commonwealth<br/>&amp; Development Office"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"content_id":"9066fb8d-4a60-442b-8b3f-6f6c10936714","details":{"body":"<p>The UK’s Ambassador for Human Rights exists to defend and advance human rights and democracy globally. Promoting human rights and the rule of law is fundamental to maintaining stability and preventing conflict and is therefore at the heart of the UK’s interests.  </p>\n\n<p>The Ambassador for Human Rights has 3 main objectives:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>protecting and promoting human rights within the multilateral system, including at the United Nations Human Rights Council</li>\n  <li>working in partnership with countries to support and advance human rights</li>\n  <li>promoting other human rights campaigns in support of the UK’s international priorities</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The Ambassador engages with civil society and human rights defenders. Through country missions, she engages with states, human rights institutions and other international partners to champion positive progress made by states, encourage advances and identify areas for collaboration and partnership to support protections and promotion of human rights within those countries.</p>\n","role_payment_type":null},"document_type":"ambassador_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-02T16:11:40Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Ambassador for Human Rights and Deputy Permanent Representative to the United Nations and other International Organisations in Geneva ","withdrawn":false}],"speaker":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","base_path":"/government/people/eleanor-sanders","content_id":"4301c606-5fdc-4e77-bbf1-1dbce629f3c8","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2024-09-24T08:38:41Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Eleanor Sanders","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/eleanor-sanders","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/international/human-rights-internationally","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/international/human-rights-internationally","base_path":"/international/human-rights-internationally","content_id":"cb7db7bb-d0b4-4e22-9f0b-58a28c2db38c","details":{"internal_name":"Human rights internationally [P]","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/international","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/international","base_path":"/international","content_id":"37d0fa26-abed-4c74-8835-b3b51ae1c8b2","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"International","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors"